# labels under each (three and two); the tall drawing's viewBox ending at 311; the lists' and the notes' role="list";
# the new texts and none of the old; the drawings' rules on live pages alone; the live page loading nothing from
# another host; the narrow min-heights, the 360-pixel cap, the labels at the drawing's scale, and the stepper lined
# up on the title's first line, in the stylesheet.
# Each of 23 changes to the page, made in a copy of it, made render.py fail: the moderated note says 'you' again;
# the open community's first list without its role; the notes without their role; the tall reply about the app repo
# again; a word of the agent drawing's description; a tall label's line; a wide label; the description unescaped; a
# script from another host; an @import; a background from another host; a picture's href to another host; an
# xlink:href to another host; a stylesheet link; the drawings' rules on every page; the dead rule back; the live
# sharing line as before; the sharing line while connecting as before; the tall drawing as tall as the guide's; the
# narrow min-height; the tall drawing uncapped; the stepper centered again; the tall labels not at the drawing's
# scale.

